    "finalName": "",
    "description": "When you create a <b>Force Talisman</b>, you can select a single <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Force_Power\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Force Power\">Force Power</a> from your <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Force_Power_Suite\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Force Power Suite\">Force Power Suite</a>. Whenever you are wearing this <b>Focused Force Talisman</b> and activate the selected <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Force_Power\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Force Power\">Force Power</a>, you can spend a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Force_Point\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Force Point\">Force Point</a> to immediately regain all your expended uses of that spent <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Force_Power\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Force Power\">Force Power</a>, adding it to your <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Force_Power_Suite\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Force Power Suite\">Force Power Suite</a>.",
